        },
        "row1": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "row",
            "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
            "gap": 16,
            "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "a": {
              "type": "group",
              "settings": {
                "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
                "gap": 6,
                "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
                "border": "solid",
                "border_radius": 8,
                "padding-block-start": 20,
                "padding-block-end": 20,
                "padding-inline-start": 20,
                "padding-inline-end": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Will it arrive before Halloween?</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "h4",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                    "font_size": "1.0625rem"
                  }
                },
                "a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes if you order by Tuesday, October 20. We ship tracked from inside the US within 24 hours. After that date we keep shipping but we stop promising the 31st &mdash; we would rather tell you no than take your money on a maybe.</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.9375rem",
                    "text_color": "#5B5B5B"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q",
                "a"
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "group",
              "settings": {
                "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
                "gap": 6,
                "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
                "border": "solid",
                "border_radius": 8,
                "padding-block-start": 20,
                "padding-block-end": 20,
                "padding-inline-start": 20,
                "padding-inline-end": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Does any of it need an outlet?</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "h4",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                    "font_size": "1.0625rem"
                  }
                },
                "a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The reapers are solar and need nothing at all. The ghost swings light themselves. The projector is the only piece that plugs in.</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.9375rem",
                    "text_color": "#5B5B5B"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q",
                "a"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "a",
            "b"
          ]
        },
        "row2": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "row",
            "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
            "gap": 16,
            "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "a": {
              "type": "group",
              "settings": {
                "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
                "gap": 6,
                "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
                "border": "solid",
                "border_radius": 8,
                "padding-block-start": 20,
                "padding-block-end": 20,
                "padding-inline-start": 20,
                "padding-inline-end": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>How long does setup take?</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "h4",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                    "font_size": "1.0625rem"
                  }
                },
                "a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>About four minutes per reaper, about a minute per swing, under a minute for the projector. A full three-level yard is well under an hour, with no tools.</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.9375rem",
                    "text_color": "#5B5B5B"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q",
                "a"
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "group",
              "settings": {
                "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
                "gap": 6,
                "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
                "border": "solid",
                "border_radius": 8,
                "padding-block-start": 20,
                "padding-block-end": 20,
                "padding-inline-start": 20,
                "padding-inline-end": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "q": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Does the reaper move or make noise?</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "h4",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                    "font_size": "1.0625rem"
                  }
                },
                "a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. It is completely silent and it does not animate. The whole effect is light &mdash; no motor to break and nothing waking the street at 2am.</p>",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.9375rem",
                    "text_color": "#5B5B5B"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "q",
                "a"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
